        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Plainview, Jeffersontown, Jefferson County, Kentucky, Louisville, United States\n- Companies: Papa John's Pizza\n- Topics: population, headquarters, neighborhood, dairy farm, pizza delivery chain\n\nFacts:\n- Plainview is a neighborhood in Jeffersontown, Kentucky, and it is located on the former site of the Plainview Dairy Farm.\n- Jeffersontown is a home rule-class city in Jefferson County, Kentucky, United States.\n- The 2010 U.S. census recorded Jeffersontown's population as 26,595.\n- Papa John's Pizza operates the third largest take-out and pizza delivery restaurant chain in the United States.\n- Papa John's Pizza has its headquarters in Jeffersontown, Kentucky, a suburb of Louisville.",
